Suggests: network-manager-vless-gnome, network-manager-vless-kde
Description: NetworkManager VPN plugin for VLESS (Xray) - core service
 Adds VLESS connections to NetworkManager. This package contains the VPN service,
 command-line tools, subscription updater and shared integration files.
 .
 Install network-manager-vless-gnome for the GNOME Settings editor or
 network-manager-vless-kde for the KDE Plasma NetworkManager editor.
 .
 The package includes a verified build of Xray-core, which runs as an
 unprivileged user.

